==================================================
PROJECT CONCEPT
==================================================

"My Museum" is a personal archive for collecting things I don't want to forget.

It is not a reading tracker, Goodreads clone, productivity app, or generic note-taking app.

The core idea is:

"Things I don't want to forget."

Users can save:
- memorable quotes
- interesting dialogue
- plot developments
- character dynamics
- writing techniques
- beautiful expressions
- scene ideas
- worldbuilding ideas
- creative ideas
- observations about why a piece of writing works
- anything else that makes the user stop and think "I want to remember this."

The project is primarily for personal use.

Each saved item is treated as an "exhibit" in a personal museum.

The most important part is not only what was saved, but also why it was saved.

